Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFEFF&\3c&H535660&}New Sumiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:13.15,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I apologize for bothering you \Nwith such an unexpected request.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:15.34,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for taking care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:21.79,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I am sure that the guest who brought \Nthese in will be pleased with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:26.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I do hope so. Thank you very much \Nfor entrusting us with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:33.80,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, was it? If something else \Ncomes up, we may be contacting you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:38.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course! Kinme Cleaning \Nwould be very happy to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.55,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,This is the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:46.44,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Yes. So you are finished with the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.44,Italics Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,The ceiling is so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:50.06,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll be sure to replace those later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:50.80,Italics Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,I've never been to such \Na magnificent old inn before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.73,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Oh. Yes. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:55.40,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:01:00.38,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,It sounds like they \Njust finished cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:02.45,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Really? In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:06.27,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I feel this must be another good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.47,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,If you have time, \Nwould you like to take a dip?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:16.22,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,We have an open-air bath on the roof \Nthat we call the Sky-High Bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:18.56,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Would you like to try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:44.42,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\c&HB8B74C&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\\clip(160,82,167,129)\t(16,893,1 \clip(153,76,277,123))\pos(164,88)\fad(1,187)} Wash {\c&H121A2E&}It
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:44.42,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:03:00.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(508,62)}Episode{\c&H8065C7&} 6    {\c&HA49F43&}Pop, {\c&H020201}Pop, Boom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:55.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This really is sky high!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:14.23,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,It was time for my lunch break anyway. \NI'm sure this is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.61,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:20.85,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I had so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The water was just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:54.05,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,My pleasure. I'm glad you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:58.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The view was also amazing. \NTruly spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:04:03.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I do feel a little ashamed using the bath \Nwhen I came for a delivery, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.74,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,It's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.44,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Oh, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:12.44,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,since you're already here, would you mind \Nif I asked you to do one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.99,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,This time it's not for a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:18.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course. I would be happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:23.95,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Didn't you also say that you could \Nclean items other than clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:30.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We also clean bags, shoes, leather \Nand fabric accessories, and oth—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:32.96,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,This is who I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A traditional Japanese doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:42.92,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I happened to find her the other day \Nwhen I was cleaning at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:47.18,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I bought her for my daughter \Nwhen she was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:50.48,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,so it doesn't seem right \Nto just throw her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:54.36,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,I thought I might clean her up \Nso I can put her on display somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:58.61,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,At first, I was planning \Nto clean her myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.60,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,but as soon as I tried combing her hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:05.49,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,it got tangled up and I was afraid of\N damaging it or yanking some out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.73,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,It appears a little too difficult for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:13.06,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,What do you think? Or is a doll \Ntoo far outside your area of expertise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:23.39,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The fabric looks like \Nit's probably real kimono material.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:27.39,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Her makeup still remains intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.85,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,but her face and hands are filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.61,0:05:34.89,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But this is probably grime \Nfrom being handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:42.12,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The hostess's daughter must have \Ntaken this doll with her everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:48.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, I've never taken care of \Na traditional doll before,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:51.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I'm not sure if it will live up \Nto your expectations or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:58.49,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but I will do my best \Nto restore her to her original beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:00.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Please allow me to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:05.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFEFF&\3c&H535660&\fad(1475,1)}New Sumiya
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:15.07,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,This might turn out to be \Na pretty difficult job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:20.28,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I felt like I owed her \Nfor letting me use the bath for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:23.95,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But I shouldn't turn down a request \Nfrom a brand new customer, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:27.37,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Hopefully, this will lead to\N other opportunities as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello. You're sure out early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:41.71,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. We just had \Nthe end-of-term assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:46.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. Students go on \Nsummer break starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:53.14,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I get stuck helping out \Nat home because the inn gets so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:57.65,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We're right on the beach,\N so we get tons of tourists,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:00.74,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,and there are fireworks shows \Nlike every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:05.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I see what you mean. \NYes, that would be a lot to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:08.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But since it finally is summer vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:11.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,be sure to drop it off sometime, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:12.41,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:18.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I still haven't forgotten about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.22,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sure. Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.70,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\frx8\fry340\c&H0F0E0E&\3c&HC1C7C8&\fs30\frz3.142\pos(286,128)}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.75,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Even if it's my first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:06.06,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,the essential principles of washing \Nand stain removal are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:10.38,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Examine the condition closely...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.73,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,and assess the nature of the stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.48,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Work without haste...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.10,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,and with great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.06,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I don't know why, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:10.84,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,This should be my first time \Nworking on a Japanese doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:15.14,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,and yet it somehow feels very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.64,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:24.51,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I must have done jobs like this \Nbefore I lost my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFEFF&\3c&H535660&}New Sumiya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.81,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.63,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Just look at how clean she's gotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.71,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.66,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,And right on the heels of your last job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:57.33,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,So how about you take a break \Nin our grand bath this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:00.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I can't keep imposing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:06.70,Default,Hostess,0,0,0,,Please, be my guest. \NYou do like hot springs, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.84,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H434C50&\3c&HD3E2E7&}Ladies\N{\fs18\c&HB9C8ED&\3c&H3D4296&}Atami Hot Springs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:22.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Now let's see what tomorrow brings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:29.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(90,254)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:34.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,246)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:37.57,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\c&H707074&\3c&HD0D3D6&}Atami Moon Terrace
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.41,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H6E675B&\3c&HEEE9E5&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.76,Flashback,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sure. Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.12,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:14.55,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.32,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:20.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:24.62,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You're always such an early bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:27.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, the town is usually \Npretty quiet at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.21,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.31,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, actually, this is great timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:35.18,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Can I send some laundry along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:36.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:40.32,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I meant to take it to you a few days back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:43.62,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,but things get so busy this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:45.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, it is summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:50.07,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tonight is another fireworks show, \Nso we're all booked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:52.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, there's another one tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs17\c&HD7DFE5&\3c&H393ACE&\blur2\move(325,9,325,1,0,2735)}Atami\N{\fs20}Seaside Fireworks Show\N{\fs8}A Symphony of Fireworks Painting the Sky with Seasonal Colors
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HECE9E6&\3c&H9171CD&\blur2\move(239,233,231,245,24,2735)}Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HECE9E6&\3c&HD68C58&\blur2\move(293,233,291,245,0,2735)}Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HACCFFF&\3c&H3775C2&\blur2\move(347,233,352,245,0,2735)}Fall
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HECE9E6&\3c&HB566D3&\blur2\move(402,233,414,245,24,2735)}Winter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs8\c&H5A5A63&\3c&HDDDCE2&\bord3\b1\move(324,309,322,329,24,2735)}Please help us keep your trip to Atami safe and comfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.09,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's pretty much every week now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:58.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So is Kyusho-kun lending a hand again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:12:59.59,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:02.75,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I'm running him ragged these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.85,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,He's in the back. Should I get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:09.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, that's all right. \NAnyway, I'll take care of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.17,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.20,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.80,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Have a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.09,Default,Kid 1,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:47.63,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:56.15,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Buzz, buzz-buzz, bu-bu-bu-buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:58.56,Default - Top,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I guess it's that season again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:58.56,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Hey there, twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.65,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:00.65,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,Heya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.95,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,If you're just killing time, \Ncome and give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:08.04,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,No can do! We're on our way \Nto work right now, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.41,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh! That looks like a Kyu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.03,0:14:12.96,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:14.84,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:21.80,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Man, it's so hot outside! \NMust be nice in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:27.16,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Nah, it's really hot inside too. \NWe don't even have the AC on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:28.99,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.63,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Okay. Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.68,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:43.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H64BFD1&\3c&H5D5D65&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.84,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:09.33,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,The guests will be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:10.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.98,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I saw Kinme-san this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.87,0:15:19.69,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You didn't have anything \Nfor her to wash, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:22.55,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,No, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:25.00,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,No? Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:40.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It looks like this button is coming loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:41.88,Default,Male Customer,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll fix this one for you on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:48.59,Default,Male Customer,0,0,0,,I appreciate that. \NI'm no good with stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.64,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H5A5EBA&\3c&H9CA5E7&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:55.38,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Welcome! Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.56,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I can take your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:02.21,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I'll show you to your room. \NThis way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:08.76,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\pos(321,128)\fs30}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:08.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H555152&\3c&HE7E8E9&\fs30\pos(323,263)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax0.26\frz339.7\pos(281,192)\shad0\b1\c&H9F96DA&\3c&HF4F8FB&}Magisa
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.05,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Sure is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.93,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,It definitely is summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:38.21,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:41.22,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.34,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I never see you with such a long face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:45.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:50.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, actually, at the festival \Nthe other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.66,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Whoa! With a customer's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:13.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,H-Honestly, it was just an accident. \NI was still wearing my festival mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:16.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but our lips did sort of \Nbump against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:19.98,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Then it doesn't even count.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:27.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,B-But ever since then, \NI've felt like he's been avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.61,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:33.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Th-That must mean\N I made him uncomfortable, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:34.74,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:40.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,H-How am I ever supposed \Nto face that customer again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:42.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:47.49,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:52.01,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,That is so like you, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:55.70,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,The kid is still in high school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:18:03.14,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You didn't make him uncomfortable. \NHe's probably just embarrassed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Embarrassed? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:14.28,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,The fact that you don't get it \Nis so adorable, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.57,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Don't waste any energy worrying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:21.69,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,It'll work itself out in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:24.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:27.13,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.28,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hah! Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:33.62,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,'Scuse me. I brought you some more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,K... Kuriru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:41.06,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, Kinme-san? Sup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:45.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NHow long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.88,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,What am I doing? My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:53.76,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,And how long? Well, before you \Nand your friend came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:57.82,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, the girl who took your order \Nis another part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:02.02,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:04.49,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sup. She's my wardrobe advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:06.33,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.59,0:19:12.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kuriru-chan, did you, uh, \Nhear all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:14.09,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,All of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wh-What we were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:23.35,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh? Not a word. \NI'm way too busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.35,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Can I order, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:26.85,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Ah, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:29.03,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Anyway, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:37.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't be talking about things \Nlike that in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.24,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, sounds like they're starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:47.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:49.53,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Let's pay up and head outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:51.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.70,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.41,Default,People,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:30.58,Default,People,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:32.04,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,It's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:35.55,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Hey, son. Another beer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:36.81,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:41.86,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,293.467)}Translation:\NEditing and Typesetting:
