Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:46.87,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(455,209.319)}Riley Dalton\NSriram Gurunathan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:09.28,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnVerdana\c&HB88A84&\3c&H4F2817&}Sushi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.08,Default,Chef,0,0,0,,Here ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.49,0:23:18.03,Default,Chef,0,0,0,,Come in. Go ahead and take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:27.29,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Plates, tea cups, \Nbeer mugs, kanpyo rolls...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:31.53,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,It gets way too busy on fireworks days!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.83,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Ugh, fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(296,154)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}7  {\c&H020201}You Should Leverage Your {\c&HA49F43&}Assets{\c&H020201&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:39.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is "You Should \NLeverage Your Assets."
